    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikengila Gog",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ni in wod dhano, tuci wac paran kwoŋ Gog, aka iwaci ama: Rwoth Were waco ama, alwenyo kodin, awi Gog, wod kere pa Mesek kodi Tubal! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alawirin awirawira t'adhirin yumalo, t'akelin wok iy'adec mabor ma yumalo t'aterin kwoŋ gote ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamuko kwot perin wok i cingin maracam, t'amiyo aserin perin oy wok i cingin maracuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibino podho wi gote ma Isiraili, in kodi jolweny perin kodi ji ma jonitie kodin. Alamiyin ri winyin madudi ma nger gi nger kodi ri ogwaŋe madudi jowocamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilapodho i kisawe; kole atieko luwo, Rwoth Were waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aladhiro mac kwoŋ Magog kodi kwoŋ jono ma jobedo ma bu teko i thengi nam; aka jobino ŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamiyo nyingan woŋeyere i dier ji paran Isiraili; aka ak'oyey nyingan wokoc kendo; aka nonin jobino ŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth, Ŋataleŋ pa Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otieko bino! Otieko timere, Rwoth Were waco. Me a ndelo m'oyido atieko luwo kwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jono ma jobedo i tindin madongo ma Isiraili jolawok woko to jotimo mac ma lweny to jowaŋo jo, kwote, mikoro kodi aserin, abiro kodi tonge; aka jolatimo mac wok i jo ma oro abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jok'ocoki yen i ndelin kosa toŋo yen i lule, rupiri jolabedo gi gilweny m'owey awaŋa. Jolajowo to jonyaga gigipiny pa jono ma jonyaga jo, Rwoth Were waco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yiko Gog",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ama: I ndelo no alamiyo Gog kayik i Isiraili, i milelo pa Jowoth yuwok ceŋ ma nam; bino geŋo ger pa jowoth, rupiri kenyo Gog kodi kitipa pere je ilayik'iye jo; ibino lwoŋo ni Milelo pa Hamon Gog. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jolacowo dwe abirio ka joyiko jo, ma cwako reco ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji je ma piny jolayiko jo; aka lakelo rijo dwoŋ i ndelo m'abino nyuth'iye dwoŋ paran, apaka Rwoth Were waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolaketho cwo ma jolawoth i piny kisi hongo ma yiko del pa jom'otho ma jodoŋ i piny, ŋey jowocidi woko reco mere. Ma dwe abirio joladwaro jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka joma dwaro jowotho i piny, kisi nyatoro m'onen coko dhano ketho ranyuth cegin gine, cuka joma yiko jotiek yiko i Milelo pa Hamon Gog. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Tindi madwoŋ Hamona bende nitie kenyo.) Ameno jolacido woko reco ma piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.17+REV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 19:17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ri in, Wod dhano, Rwoth Were waco ama: Luw gi winyin ma nger gi nger kodi ogwaŋe mager je ni: Cokere win wibin, cokere win wok i thenge je ri kalima ma cowirok m'ayiko riwin, kalima ma cowirok madwoŋ wi gote ma Isiraili, aka wibino camo riŋo to wimadho remo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilacamo riŋo pa jomeni to wimadho remo pa wot kerin ma piny, apa rombo ma mon, apa diegi, apa thwondhe, joje ma jocwe ma Basan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilacamo bor cuka wiyeŋ, to wimadho remo cuka wimer i kalima ma cowirok m'ayiko riwin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilayeŋo i dhower paran gi kayinin kodi jogwey, gi jolweny apondi kodi jolweny ma nger gi nger, apaka Rwoth Were waco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dwoko pa Isiraili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alanyutho dwoŋ paran i dier nonin; aka nonin je jolaneno thumo banja paran m'atieko thumo, aka cingan m'atieko ketho kwoŋ jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jolaŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth Were pajo, wok i ndelo no kadho yuwaŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonin jolaŋeyo ni Joisiraili jokidho i katwec ro reco pajo, rupiri oyido jobedo jobanirok kodan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiyo gi jo paka koco kodi kibenga pajo obedo, t'apano waŋan rijo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Rwoth Were waco ama: Pama onyo aladwoko silwany pa Yakobo, t'atimo ŋono ri Joisiraili gibe; aka alabedo gi nyeko ri nyingan maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
