              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka jobino ŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth Were pajo rupiri adhiro jo i katwec i dier nonin, nyaka t'acoko jo i piny pajo won. Ongoye kwoŋ jo ŋat'alaweyo cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
